  "description": "On a new ACCDB with table T (2 rows), opens an ADO connection (Provider ACE OLE DB) and calls Connection.Execute(CommandText, RecordsAffected, Options) with RecordsAffected passed by reference: as VT_BYREF|VT_VARIANT holding Empty, as typed VT_BYREF|VT_I4 holding 0, and by value (I4 0). The statement is UPDATE T SET N = 'x', then UPDATE T SET N = 'y' WHERE ID = 99. Asks what ADO writes back into a by-reference RecordsAffected and what it does with a by-value one.",
